um length of result string (including null terminator)\n    \n    Returns:\n        bool: True if at minimum the characteristic fits, False otherwise\n    \"\"\"\n    # Convert to common denominator\n    common_denom = d1 * d2\n    total_num = (c1 * d1 + n1) * d2 - (c2 * d2 + n2) * d1\n    total_denom = common_denom\n    \n    # Calculate characteristic and mantissa of result\n    result_char = total_num // total_denom\n    result_num = abs(total_num % total_denom)\n    \n    # Build result string\n    result_str = str(result_char)\n    \n    # Check if characteristic fits\n    if len(result_str) > max_len:\n        return False\n    \n    # If there's a fractional part, add decimal point and digits\n    if result_num > 0:\n        result_str += '.'\n        remaining = result_num\n        remaining_denom = total_denom\n        \n        # Add as many decimal digits as will fit\n        while remaining > 0 and len(result_str) < max_len:\n            remaining *= 10\n            digit = remaining // remaining_denom\n            result_str += str(digit)\n            remaining = remaining % remaining_denom\n            \n            if remaining == 0:\n                break\n    \n    # Copy to result array\n    for i in range(len(result_str)):\n        result[i] = result_str[i]\n    \n    return True\n",
